                  <p className="text-sm md:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4 text-gray-700">
                    Our expertise extends beyond the initial application. We engage in aggressive, evidence based negotiations with the bank's resolution departments. We understand the internal metrics and recovery targets of these institutions, allowing us to secure settlement terms that are vastly superior to what an individual could negotiate independently. We ensure that all agreements are formalized in legally binding documentation, protecting you from any future claims or hidden liabilities. By choosing AMA Legal Solutions, you transform a terrifying and confusing process into a structured, legally sound pathway to financial freedom. If you are struggling with unmanageable debt, do not risk your future on unverified portals; <Link href="/contact" className="text-[#D2A02A] hover:underline font-semibold">contact our expert team</Link> today for a confidential assessment of your resolution options.
                  </p>
